-~> symbols are drawn by hand.
-~> Each glyph is a list of [y, x0, x1] runs of set pixels: y counts from
-~> the glyph's top, x0 is inclusive and x1 exclusive. "fallback" is the
-~> hollow box drawn for a character the font lacks.
